# Project: Track My Subscription — Premium SaaS Subscription Management Platform

## 1. Project Overview

Build a complete, production-ready subscription tracking SaaS web application named **Track My Subscription**.

The application should allow users to manage all their recurring subscriptions in one place, monitor monthly and yearly expenses, receive renewal reminders, analyze spending, parse invoices using AI, import subscriptions in bulk, and connect external applications using webhooks.

Use the uploaded dashboard screenshot as the primary UI reference. Adapt its three-part layout, compact navigation, KPI cards, spending analytics, transaction list, and right-side AI assistant panel for a modern subscription management platform.

Do not create only a static UI or frontend prototype. All forms, dashboards, authentication, database operations, reports, settings, and integrations must work and persist data through Supabase.

